sequenceDiagram

    actor Student
    participant UI as Assistant UI
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant MC as Moodle Connector
    participant Moodle
    participant Context as Context Builder
    participant Gemini as Gemini API
    participant DB as Assistant DB

    Student->>UI: Ask question
    UI->>API: Submit question

    API->>Agent: Process question

    Agent->>MC: Request assignments/deadlines
    MC->>Moodle: Authenticated API request
    Moodle-->>MC: Assignment data

    MC-->>Agent: Relevant Moodle data

    Agent->>Context: Build context
    Context->>DB: Check cached data
    DB-->>Context: Context data
    Context-->>Agent: Prepared context

    Agent->>Gemini: Question + prompt + context
    Gemini-->>Agent: Generated answer

    Agent->>DB: Store conversation
    Agent-->>API: Final answer

    API-->>UI: Response
    UI-->>Student: Display answer